{"type":"message","id":"49fcd827","parentId":"cbb8efca","timestamp":"2026-03-14T04:57:24.004Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的！360是可用的。现在让我验证一下几个失败的搜索引擎，看看具体的失败原因："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 详细测试几个失败的搜索引擎，记录失败原因\n\necho \"=== 详细诊断失败的搜索引擎 ===\"\necho \"\"\n\n# Google\necho \"1. Google 详细诊断...\"\nGOOGLE_CURL=$(curl -sL --max-time 15 --connect-timeout 10 -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\\n\" \\\n  -H \"User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\" \\\n  \"https://www.google.com/search?q=OpenAI\" 2>&1)\nHTTP_CODE=$(echo \"$GOOGLE_CURL\" | grep \"HTTP_CODE:\" | cut -d: -f2)\nif [ \"$HTTP_CODE\" = \"200\" ]; then\n  echo \"   HTTP状态: 200，但内容不匹配\"\nelif echo \"$GOOGLE_CURL\" | grep -q \"timed out\\|Connection timed out\"; then\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: 连接超时\"\nelif echo \"$GOOGLE_CURL\" | grep -q \"Could not resolve\\|Could not connect\"; then\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: 无法连接 (可能被墙或DNS问题)\"\nelse\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: HTTP $HTTP_CODE 或内容不匹配\"\nfi\n\n# DuckDuckGo\necho \"2. DuckDuckGo 详细诊断...\"\nDDG_CURL=$(curl -sL --max-time 15 --connect-timeout 10 -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\\n\" \\\n  -H \"User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\" \\\n  \"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=OpenAI\" 2>&1)\nHTTP_CODE=$(echo \"$DDG_CURL\" | grep \"HTTP_CODE:\" | cut -d: -f2)\nif [ \"$HTTP_CODE\" = \"200\" ]; then\n  echo \"   HTTP状态: 200，但内容不匹配\"\nelif echo \"$DDG_CURL\" | grep -q \"timed out\"; then\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: 连接超时\"\nelif echo \"$DDG_CURL\" | grep -q \"Could not resolve\"; then\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: DNS解析失败\"\nelse\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: HTTP $HTTP_CODE 或连接问题\"\nfi\n\n# Brave\necho \"3. Brave 详细诊断...\"\nBRAVE_CURL=$(curl -sL --max-time 15 --connect-timeout 10 -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE:%{http_code}\\n\" \\\n  -H \"User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\" \\\n  \"https://search.brave.com/search?q=OpenAI\" 2>&1)\nHTTP_CODE=$(echo \"$BRAVE_CURL\" | grep \"HTTP_CODE:\" | cut -d: -f2)\nif [ \"$HTTP_CODE\" = \"200\" ]; then\n  echo \"   HTTP状态: 200，但内容不匹配\"\nelse\n  echo \"   ❌ 原因: HTTP $HTTP_CODE 或连接问题\"\nfi","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773464217359}}
